  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 3M™ Dual Lock Reclosable Fastener simplifies use, offering both durability and convenience. The mushroom-shaped heads allow parts to slide easily into place before securely locking together. Once fastened, the connectors are hidden, leaving a smooth and clean surface."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Pixel Puzzle Maker"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Pixel Puzzle Maker is your gateway to nostalgic 8-bit style pixel art! With this innovative tool from MakerLab, you can effortlessly transform any image into a customizable pixelated graphic. What's more, you can automatically convert it into a printable colored pixel puzzle! Tailor the size and level of detail to your liking, and enjoy the convenience of marked color codes on the base plate for swift assembly. Freeze the moments worth recording in life, and transform them into pixel puzzles. Paired with Reclosable Fastener Mounting Tape, this is an excellent choice for displaying Pixel Puzzle on a variety of surfaces, including metals, glass, and plastics. This innovative fastener combines convenience and durability, making it ideal for temporary and permanent applications. The 3M™ Dual Lock Reclosable Fastener is easy to apply and reposition. It can be easily removed and reapplied without losing its adhesive properties. This feature allows for adjustments until you achieve the perfect placement for your Pixel Puzzle, no need to worry about leaving visible holes or marks. The Mushroom-shaped Heads interlocks securely, providing a robust bond that ensures that your Pixel Puzzle remains firmly in place, without worrying about it falling off."
    },
