  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p>The 3M™ Dual Lock Reclosable Fastener simplifies use, offering both durability and convenience. The mushroom-shaped heads allow parts to slide easily into place before securely locking together. Once fastened, the connectors are hidden, leaving a smooth and clean surface.</p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><strong>Pixel Puzzle Maker</strong></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<div class=\"pct_head-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">  <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/92990bca53474de2a361ce329675fd02/Puzzle_Maker.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"DcaQdzrMEo4cnsxoD0icrcKXnqe\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R7FIdQTuNoFlWsxcBlUc5gAInyf\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/makerlab/pixelPuzzleMaker?from=makerlab\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Pixel Puzzle Maker</strong></a></span> is your gateway to nostalgic 8-bit style pixel art! With this innovative tool from MakerLab, you can effortlessly transform any image into a customizable pixelated graphic. What's more, you can automatically convert it into a printable colored pixel puzzle! Tailor the size and level of detail to your liking, and enjoy the convenience of marked color codes on the base plate for swift assembly.</div>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KQM4dbWZwot7hUx8zNfcryMMnng\"><br/></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A6Andi1EwoIagfxtzdac797Xn0d\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"DcaQdzrMEo4cnsxoD0icrcKXnqe\">\n<div>Freeze the moments worth recording in life, and transform them into pixel puzzles. Paired with <strong>Reclosable Fastener Mounting Tape</strong>, this is an excellent choice for displaying Pixel Puzzle on a variety of surfaces, including metals, glass, and plastics. This innovative fastener combines convenience and durability, making it ideal for temporary and permanent applications.</div>\n</div>\n<span data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"DcaQdzrMEo4cnsxoD0icrcKXnqe\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Seize reminiscent, conserve wonders, freeze the moments worth recording in life, and transform them into pixel puzzles. Paired with Reclosable Fastener Mounting Tape, this is an excellent choice for displaying Pixel Puzzle on a variety of surfaces, including metals, glass, and plastics. This innovative fastener combines convenience and durability, making it ideal for temporary and permanent applications.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+3o*0*1+x*0+6q\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7446216827937751043\"],\"1\":[\"bold\",\"true\"]},\"nextNum\":2}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"pasteRandomId\":\"72ba25fb-8580-4f9f-8a3d-e6096a123ec9\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":331,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":407},\"recordId\":\"A6Andi1EwoIagfxtzdac797Xn0d\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<di